  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/src/main/resources/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"150\"><br></p><h1>实体模型特性</h1><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4I1XuqiY/images/49f5b98dfef5b073a3971750673d343e1f92efe5.png\" width=\"550\"><br></p><hr><h1>关于</h1><p>实体模型特性（EMF）是一款基于 Fabric、Forge 和 NeoForge 的模组，新增了对 OptiFine 自定义实体模型（CEM）的支持。</p><p>专为那些想使用 CEM 资源包功能，同时使用 Sodium、Continuity 或 ETF 等 OptiFine 替代模组的玩家设计。</p><h1>前置模组</h1><p>如果可能，请同时安装以下模组。显而易见的如 Sodium 等不再赘述。</p><p>需要特别说明：EMF 与 dorianpb 的 CEM 以及 OptiFine / OptiFabric 不兼容。</p><h4>必需</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">实体纹理特性（ETF）</a>：EMF 使用了我的另一个模组 ETF 的若干功能，因此必须安装。（主要用于支持随机模型功能、配置界面，并允许在模型中设置的纹理像 OptiFine 那样变化）</li>\n</ul><h4>强烈推荐</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentityculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">实体剔除（Entity Culling）</a>：该模组能显著减少实体渲染卡顿，甚至比 Sodium 自带的实体剔除效果更好。在使用如 Fresh Animations 等动画密集型资源包时尤为有用。</li>\n</ul><h1>Fresh Animations（新鲜动画）？</h1><p>是的。</p><p>它可用 :)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4I1XuqiY/images/2f32dbeadc25e46ef6c56f0e47e5eb5d305c8ea2.png\" width=\"450\"><br></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252ffresh-animations-v1-0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载 Fresh Animations</a></p><h1>特性、与 OptiFine 的差异及已知问题</h1><p>最新特性详情页面：<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/FEATURES.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">特性与 Optifine 差异</a></p><hr><h1>更新日志</h1><p>更新日志可在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/changelog.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>查看。</p><hr><h1>需要帮助或有疑问？</h1><p>您可以通过我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>（首选）联系，或在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交问题。</p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p><hr><h2>托管合作伙伴特惠</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d641\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BVzZfTc1/images/bfb592538f8206a6a2d72d19c90714bea91b0e07.png\" alt=\"image\"></a></p>",
